      <div class="steps reveal">
        <div class="step"><span class="step-n">1</span><div><b>搵助理</b><p>㩒下面個掣，一秒搵到助理</p></div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="step-n">2</span><div><b>免費入群</b><p>助理即時回覆，帶你入實戰社群</p></div></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="step-n">3</span><div><b>一齊部署</b><p>睇今期科技股下一步點部署</p></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="final-cta reveal">
